    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "I can return her to you, Wei."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "...Don't do it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Oh? You and your mighty executioners have made my life hell."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Of course I'm willing to return her to you... But the cuffs on her body will tear Lungmen in half."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Damn you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Wei, this is the method you used against me. The way you forced me out of Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "But now, our roles are reversed. I'm the guest, as well as the poisoner."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Kashchey. You killed my brother."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "No, no, Wei. You slew your own brother."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "My role is irrelevant. Your brother's tragedy may have come from a Unicorn's secret orders, or from the wrath of a Lung. Whether it was me who leaked the news... ultimately, does not matter."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "What's important, Wei, the one thing you mustn't forget... is that your Chi Xiao drank his blood. You did it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Chi Xiao, the dragonslaying sword. And who is it that this blade slew? Your friends. Your family. Your people."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Dragonslaying sword? How ironic that your people forged a weapon that would be turned against its own kind."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "You've gone too far."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Very well. I offer you a choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Choose. Slay me, and take back your niece, but lose your city as a result. Or, let us walk free."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Don't draw that sword. You know the consequences."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "(Grinds teeth audibly)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Relax, Wei. I've let you choose your own fate. If you don't take my generous offer, then you and I both, all your citizens, and these two lovely sisters... will all perish."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "What are you scheming?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Wei, old Wei... I know you well. Too well."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "You've always had a choice, isn't that right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "What will your precious citizens think when they hear that their lives have been placed upon a scale? And on the other side... is a young dragon whose name they've never heard."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "As for me, I don't even have a reason to hurt her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "...Since I was negligent enough to let you step foot back into this city, there's no reason to let you leave again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Tal!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Oh really?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "I'll kill you myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Now, now. There's no need for that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "My life is not yours to take."
    },
