        "text": "By the way, you can save her before I put the handcuffs on her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "But you'll also have to think about defending against me. Defeating me. Striking me down. Annihilating me... And, what I am going to do next."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kashchey",
        "text": "Wei, you're actually afraid of me, aren't you?"
    },
