    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Confessarius, answer me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "The Leader of Reunion, is there any value in forming an alliance?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Why ask me about things that you know very well, Your Majesty?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "A youth with no possessions, background, or capital cannot possibly seek to take an important Ursus city alone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "The uninfected rulers know not what to make of her actions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "They will panic, overreact, and try to resolve the chaos through more destruction \u2014 and use the chaos caused by the Infected as a front."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "But, we Sarkaz know better."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_062",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Regent",
        "text": "What do you think of the team she finally left here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "They are unworthy, Your Majesty. As you foresaw, there is no hope for them. They are not trained soldiers, unable to cause the violence that we seek."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_062"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Regent",
        "text": "Eliminating them will not sever Talulah's power. We lack an opportunity to take her out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Right, Your Majesty."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "The situation that she fomented and the power she wielded to force the issue... shows that she is no one-eyed leader among the blind, or some pampered princeling awaiting the throne."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "She is a conspirator."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_062"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Regent",
        "text": "Even if that is the case, I require a comprehensive response from the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "In that case, I have two bits of good news. First, we already have a lead on our search for the Lord of Fiends."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Rhodes Island hasn't yet been manipulated by foreign forces."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_062"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Regent",
        "text": "Don't waste time. We need her to begin right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_055"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "Please do not be angered, and hear me out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius",
        "text": "'She' is ready."
    },
